            <ArticleTitle>[Scrotal Mass as a Rare Initial Manifestation of Necrotising Pancreatitis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>309-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1055/s-0035-1548877</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A scrotal mass as initial manifestation of necrotising pancreatitis is very rare. In addition, the diagnosis is very difficult because diseases that occur more frequently produce similar symptoms. Therefore, it is very important to think about rare entities in the differential diagnosis for testicular pain.</AbstractText>
